import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 614 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Alaya Network Access Protocol for the Time Domain","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 614 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Alaya Network Access Protocol for the Time Domain","no":614,"module":3,"tags":["Time Domain","Alaya Network","Access Protocol","Data Feedback","Technical Implementation"],"related":["21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principle","87-Only-Knowledge-Returned Principle","69-Technology Opening and Sharing Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0614_模块3-时间域技术实现-阿赖耶网络接入协议.md","filePath":"en/0614_模块3-时间域技术实现-阿赖耶网络接入协议.md"}'),o={name:"en/0614_模块3-时间域技术实现-阿赖耶网络接入协议.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,h){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-614-time-domain-technical-implementation-alaya-network-access-protocol-for-the-time-domain" tabindex="-1">Entry 614 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Alaya Network Access Protocol for the Time Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-614-time-domain-technical-implementation-alaya-network-access-protocol-for-the-time-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 614 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Alaya Network Access Protocol for the Time Domain&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 21, 87, 69 | Series: Time-Domain Technical Implementation (Entry 6)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-how-everything-inside-the-domain-safely-becomes-myriad-ranks-wealth" tabindex="-1">Introduction: how everything inside the domain safely becomes Myriad Ranks&#39; wealth <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-how-everything-inside-the-domain-safely-becomes-myriad-ranks-wealth" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: how everything inside the domain safely becomes Myriad Ranks&#39; wealth&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A cultivator in the Origin Acceleration Domain deduces a new gongfu; a trialist in the Quest Sediment Domain validates a principle with a lifetime&#39;s lesson. If these values only stay inside the domain, stay in a personal brain, they repeat Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; &quot;knowledge buried with the strong&quot; disaster. The dual-track time domain being a &quot;civilizational-level&quot; project relies entirely on a pipeline safely delivering domain-internal value to the whole network — the <strong>Alaya Network Access Protocol</strong>. This entry tells how this pipeline is designed: what to transmit, what not to, how to transmit, who reviews.</p><p>Six top-level axioms are the access protocol&#39;s criterion: anti-predation axiom requires access not cause knowledge private retention; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires feedback knowledge reachable network-wide; collective ascension axiom requires personal outputs convert to civilizational wealth; causal self-discipline axiom requires &quot;only-knowledge-returned,&quot; not disturb causality; law-first axiom requires protocol interfaces stable, version-able, never retcon. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-three-layer-data-flow" tabindex="-1">I. Three-Layer Data Flow <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-layer-data-flow" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three-Layer Data Flow&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The access protocol divides the data flow between time domain and Alaya Network into three layers, each with different pass rules:</p><ol><li><strong>Knowledge layer</strong>: gongfu, data, patterns, schemes — fully passed after desensitization, entering Alaya Network network-wide open. This is access&#39;s main purpose.</li><li><strong>Causal layer</strong>: concrete people, events, causal traces — intercepted, not fed back, only recorded within this domain for audit.</li><li><strong>Emotional layer</strong>: emotional impact, personality shaping during trials — converted into safely digestible teaching cases, archived after stripping concrete identity.</li></ol><p>Three-layer分流 is precisely the &quot;only-knowledge-returned principle&quot; (Document 87)&#39;s technical implementation: <strong>knowledge flows freely, causality never flows, emotion converted to cases</strong>.</p><h2 id="ii-desensitization-interface" tabindex="-1">II. Desensitization Interface <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-desensitization-interface" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Desensitization Interface&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Knowledge layer passes, but not &quot;bare-transmitted&quot; — directly pouring domain-internal raw data into the whole network may carry causal pollution or invade individual privacy. So the access protocol sets a <strong>desensitization interface</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Identity stripping</strong>: feedback data is not labeled &quot;this is so-and-so&#39;s exclusive insight,&quot; but as public knowledge entries.</li><li><strong>Causal decoupling</strong>: strip data&#39;s causal chain with specific events, only retain patterns themselves.</li><li><strong>Quality grading</strong>: low-quality, unverified feedback first enters a &quot;pending-review pool,&quot; only after Quest-Domain stress testing (Entry 501) verified is it network-wide public.</li></ul><p>The desensitization interface ensures: what Myriad Ranks get is &quot;clean knowledge,&quot; not &quot;bloody gossip&quot; or &quot;unverified wild claims.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-bidirectionality-of-feedback" tabindex="-1">III. Bidirectionality of Feedback <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-bidirectionality-of-feedback" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Bidirectionality of Feedback&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Access is not one-way &quot;domain→network,&quot; but bidirectional:</p><ul><li><strong>Domain→Network (feedback)</strong>: send domain-internal outputs into Alaya Network, network-wide shared.</li><li><strong>Network→Domain (injection)</strong>: inject the network&#39;s latest knowledge, data, comparison cases into the acceleration domain, as input for the next deduction round.</li></ul><p>This bidirectional closed loop (Entry 501) is collective-ascension axiom&#39;s technical expression: <strong>fast track eats slow track&#39;s lessons, slow track eats fast track&#39;s results</strong>. The access protocol ensures both directions are open, desensitized, traceable.</p><h2 id="iv-protocol-versioning-and-opening" tabindex="-1">IV. Protocol Versioning and Opening <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-protocol-versioning-and-opening" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Protocol Versioning and Opening&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per technology-opening and sharing mechanism (Document 69), the access protocol itself is public:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Protocol Element</th><th>Opening Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data layering rules</td><td>Public</td></tr><tr><td>Desensitization algorithms</td><td>Public</td></tr><tr><td>Quality grading standards</td><td>Public</td></tr><tr><td>Interface specs</td><td>Public, new planes may对接</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Protocol versions are legislated and iterated by the Anchor Council (Entry 618); any change leaves version records — this is law-first axiom&#39;s &quot;never retcon&quot; at the interface layer: <strong>once interface is finalized, backward-compatible, protocol not arbitrarily changed by plot need</strong>.</p><h2 id="supplementary-argument-feedback-is-the-dual-track-s-blood-circulation-not-uploading-a-file" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Argument: Feedback Is the Dual Track&#39;s &quot;Blood Circulation,&quot; Not &quot;Uploading a File&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-argument-feedback-is-the-dual-track-s-blood-circulation-not-uploading-a-file" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Argument: Feedback Is the Dual Track&#39;s &quot;Blood Circulation,&quot; Not &quot;Uploading a File&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The access protocol is often technically understood as &quot;uploading data online.&quot; This underestimates its weight. Feedback to the dual track is like blood circulation to the body — acceleration-domain outputs not fed back, the fast track manufactures civilizational &quot;varicose veins&quot;; Quest-Domain insights not fed back, the slow track&#39;s cost all sinks. The Alaya Network Access Protocol needing desensitization, grading, versioning is not for technical norms themselves, but to let this &quot;blood&quot; cleanly, continuously flow back through the whole body. Once feedback stagnates, no matter how advanced the dual track degenerates from an organic whole into two mutually inaccessible islands — that is precisely Tang Luo&#39;s secret realm&#39;s &quot;knowledge leaves with the person&quot; old disease recurring.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: feedback mechanism ensures every domain-internal output converts to network-wide wealth, not sunk with personal passing</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: desensitization interface prevents someone using feedback as cover to privately retain knowledge or smuggle causality; knowledge network-wide public</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s gongfu privately transmitted by sect; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s outputs through desensitization interface network-wide open, no-private-way</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: feedback knowledge equally open to five lineages; interface specs compatible with Myriad Ranks&#39; different data forms</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: protocol public and对接-able; any newly merged plane may接入 its own time domain to the Alaya Network</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Without the Alaya Network Access Protocol, the time domain is just isolated cultivation chambers — fast or slow, value rots inside the walls. The access protocol turns chambers into civilization&#39;s neurons: every breakthrough inside the domain becomes Myriad Ranks&#39; common property; every bit of network-wide wisdom in turn flows back into the domain to nourish the next breakthrough. The dual-track time domain being able to &quot;collectively ascend&quot; relies on this safe, transparent, bidirectional knowledge pipeline.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">Entry 21 · Symbiotic Network Operating Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/87-仅回传知识原则.html">Entry 87 · Only-Knowledge-Returned Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/69-技术开放与共享机制.html">Entry 69 · Technology Opening and Sharing Mechanism</a> · <a href="./610_模块3-时间域技术实现-加速域法则锚定工程.html">Entry 610 · Acceleration-Domain Law Anchoring</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
